{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8123f900daf5ed13078806d78fe397bfe1bcefa0bad8653bc22ebfb14c870cfc", "ja": "私たちの射手座", "zh": "我们的射手座", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d60d714709075cc1d0d7d2fe00471c39ae73abd7bd464d8994cabab2066886d8", "ja": "公演の成功を祝し、屋上でお月見をする\nメンバー達。3人はそこで、ショッピング\nモールで助けた迷子からの手紙を受け取る。\nそれを革新と挑戦の成果と受け止めた\n3人は、自らを星空の大三角形に見立てた。", "zh": "成员们来到屋顶上赏月，庆祝公演大功告成。\n此时三人从制作人手上收到了\n在购物中心帮助的迷路男孩的信。\n她们把这封信当作革新与挑战所获得的成果，\n并把自己比喻为星空中的大三角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f1bd47ac8cc914295918a99124f22bf5fd97df07bd5e3f3b8dc499734d95bdd0", "ja": "（サジタリアスの天体公演デビューは大成功。\n今日はみんなでお祝いのお月見をしようと屋上へ来た）", "zh": "（『射手座』的天体公演首次亮相大功告成。\n今天大家上来屋顶赏月，庆祝公演成功。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "e765a0402f14e0e24a5e7da5090eb0a1a54016b3e87f93ae81a32ea11e2e6299", "ja": "さっむーいっ！　うわあ、でも空が澄んでて\n月が超綺麗じゃん♪　ね、瑞希！", "zh": "好冷喔──！哇，不过天空好清澈，\n月亮超漂亮的耶♪对吧？瑞希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "4e40fe7fa4e14f3f7e0a0ae60e7d81722f8838288deae950d5f9bee6050f9e06", "ja": "月が綺麗……。もしかして、私は今、所さんに\n告白されたのでしょうか。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "月色真美……莫非所刚刚是在向我告白吗？\n……（小鹿乱撞）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "839195345a8d3283292c972894e69524b0cd816e3eb46bcde86314979286fcb4", "ja": "ん？　何言ってんの？　ま、アタシ瑞希のこと\n大好きだけどね！　あ、もちろん歩も。", "zh": "嗯？你在说什么啊？算了，\n反正我的确很喜欢瑞希啊！啊，我也喜欢步喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "1a9610bf46c3e3294dbba5fb80edf8fa317c3475a4eddf3448b9db1682d03f23", "ja": "らーぶ……イエイ。", "zh": "Love……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "41f72d81af654657a5b69a158105096a9a2cda01c377213a2004da116a81d04a", "ja": "ってアタシのこと、とってつけたように言ったな？\nむー、なんか傷つくんだけどー？", "zh": "呃，为什么说得好像我是顺便的一样？\n唔──我觉得有点受伤耶──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "c75100c9542bfb8115ce41f876f011ab00b3a05aba5b7dce6982624ecdec42eb", "ja": "にゃっははー♪　そんなわけないっしょー。\n信じて～？", "zh": "呀哈哈──♪我不是那个意思啦～\n相信我嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "efab42b232d75d1d4acb4403b96f45f679f38d4fa51429e58f30b956d0b1a061", "ja": "わあ！　いきなりくっつくなって！\nま、まあいいけどさ……へへっ♪", "zh": "哇！别突然黏上来！\n我、我是不在意啦……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a76e7cacf08310534212abded1aa9e4e102cae6c197aeb418ec474c29cb44835", "ja": "ところで、実はみんなに見せたいものがあるんだ。\n……ほら、これ。", "zh": "对了，其实我有个东西要给你们看。\n……来，就是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2e4deffd2ff4664d69af03a8451f9cbf3c1356c99d5335b7ee2de06c2fd6cb80", "ja": "ショッピングモールで出会った迷子の子だけど、\n公演に来てくれたらしくて。その子の手紙なんだ。", "zh": "上次在购物中心遇到的那个迷路的小朋友，\n他好像也有来看这次公演。这是他要给你的信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "cab98f420a5dd90672f50d54f6814a2065750c65f2b8da566d10ceb6ed425208", "ja": "えーっ！？　あの子来てくれてたんだー！\nなにそれ、超うれしいんだけど♪", "zh": "什么！？原来他也来看了！\n不会吧，我超开心的耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "22ba0458d1d07657e6ea2d19a7d7d4ef20a90c885a89fd2599314502cf0a9fa9", "ja": "そういえば、彼のお母さんは所さんのことを\n知っている様子でした。……それで、でしょうか。", "zh": "对了，当时他母亲似乎也有认出所。\n……所以才会带他来看的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1d368b7f486570fd82d1a5437b07d70a4d06a612b1d17898aad1db91ad532307", "ja": "ほら、手紙を読んでごらん、恵美。", "zh": "来，你念出信的内容吧，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "33836393721108118c0bb1650816b8a5af567aaa5a5d63d3cccc8c0a0eb163bf", "ja": "うん♪\nどれどれ？　えっと～。", "zh": "嗯♪\n我看看？呃～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "e56baf732e44030e91f5d341f36e9dad21911d47531a71c72cbf35bf4fdd27e5", "ja": "『あのとき　おねえちゃんに　\nたすけてもらったあつしです　3さいです』", "zh": "『上次帮我找到妈妈的大姊姊你好，\n我叫小敦，今年三岁。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "9843b407e75f21871b91a8d54021e24fc76e5436a409b3f664b93489a1745abd", "ja": "『おねえちゃん　ほんとう　ありがとう　ぼくも　\nこまってるひといたら　ゆうきをだして』……。", "zh": "『大姊姊，真的很谢谢你。\n我以后要是遇到有困难的人，也会鼓起勇气』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "9b2066cbd1105a540fc4b0f2a53c18b53380a599647125ac75c6bec8f2d7c58c", "ja": "『たすけてあげようと　おもいます　めぐみ\nおねえちゃん　みたく　かっこよく　なりたい』", "zh": "『去帮助他们。\n我想要变得和惠美大姊姊一样帅气。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "958d9b934785adc05f8a910899deafc716f55d7b1d0db8d55a17646bed62dcc4", "ja": "おお……。", "zh": "喔喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "f999eb14784f67e5f00c12116762c89b63d2156e757b72329a80346293f3c209", "ja": "『こんさーと　すごかった　めぐみおねえちゃん\nあいどるがんばって　ずっとおうえんする　あつし』", "zh": "『演唱会好精采，惠美大姊姊当偶像要加油，\n我也会一直帮你加油的。小敦』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "80e93a7842211bc2073cd834e1db6e66538fc5a6ab3a27486951ebfc4e1799dd", "ja": "……。嬉しい。", "zh": "……我好开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "089bf1ddfef5d23134096e29ea6cea3385dabc25eccc75b8c049fd15fc743aae", "ja": "ああ、よかったな。\nただ、こんなステキな手紙が届いたのも……", "zh": "是啊，真是太好了。\n不过，我认为能够收到这么棒的信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3eb0612fd94516c3b08668c61bbae46d4d22b734c9e78913247e5d118f8630d9", "ja": "3人が新しいことにチャレンジしようと\n頑張った成果なんだと思う。", "zh": "这也是你们三个尝试新挑战，\n努力之后的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6169c22b6733d573b73b0bd05ba8068a5e438c3b0ec4da3c06978db991577c9", "ja": "えへへ……そうだね。きっとそうだよね！\nそれと、射手座のおかげかな。", "zh": "嘿嘿……对啊，一定是这样没错！\n另外，射手座应该也有功劳吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "587d3305f3007c4e0cd8b76c9973fe455879c6ec5e5582f754f5e9fc8c269806", "ja": "射手座……そうだな。\n今はあいにく見えなくて残念だけど。", "zh": "射手座……是啊。\n可惜现在季节不对，看不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "4f4a48d71d3a99ac51190b8d33ffd0016020a8af65a398e55f2a56655f3c8290", "ja": "はい、射手座は夏の星座ですからね。\n残念です。……だけど、ほら。", "zh": "是啊，因为射手座是夏季星座。\n真可惜……不过，各位请看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142", "ja": "あっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142", "ja": "あっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4230164339d83642a514f6d22da6fb5a2178bdc50f0a0f25c21673ff4cbd699c", "ja": "ん？　みんな、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？你们怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "f58d3bb8b7dd5d0aebb2cd8996735fa13f3d8a3184d0eb2d6899dcec2dd982e2", "ja": "ほら、射手座ならここにいるよ！　39プロジェクトの\n大三角形！　なんてね。にゃはは♪", "zh": "你看，射手座就在这里啊！\n我们就是39PROJECT的大三角！像不像啊？呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b40e2091b4350816d3fe9dd61a7837fed8421ee103e3e3d4c293a946e14953c4", "ja": "なるほど。目の前に、輝く星たちがいたんだったな。\n見落としていたよ！", "zh": "原来如此，闪耀的星星就在我眼前啊。\n是我漏看了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a3a93ed524beb0c73ea84302e0be67db2df3c58201c7c55742a77232815cac36", "ja": "へへっ、これが『Lighthouse under \ndarkness』ってやつだよな！", "zh": "嘿嘿！这就叫做『Lighthouse under \ndarkness』吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "e5eb5ab4ebd7e8722d4308fc4c18b38d730ca7aadbc6994d4e8558cdf04d891f", "ja": "舞浜さん。『灯台下暗し』ということでしたら……。", "zh": "舞滨姊，如果你想说的是『丈八灯台照远不照近』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "31354b9dbbd1908e7373691c4c6873f8295177535476214c614c26efed26dca8", "ja": "『The darkest place is under the\nlighthouse』です。……とても惜しい。", "zh": "那么应该是『The darkest place is under the\nlighthouse』才对……真是可惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "20f34a3020c0e1b26f6cbac54abb4cc44af863fc11a40c5f272a0a428ca2cf7c", "ja": "うわっ、マジで！？　くぅ～、今の自信あった\nのになぁ。……もっと英語勉強しないとかな……。", "zh": "哇！真的吗！？可恶～我还以为自己讲对了……\n看来我的英语要再加强了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_07_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "16b7f45d86eb6838c54c9778eed7dc33711c229417ec67f5e54e47610694f2f4", "ja": "あはははは……！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
